## B.3 Step 1 — Create the project and wrapper

```bash
mkdir sonar-mcp-server && cd sonar-mcp-server
git init
mkdir -p src/main/java/com/lexmark/sonar/mcp/{client,config,service} src/main/resources
gradle wrapper --gradle-version 8.12.1
```

`gradle wrapper` creates `gradlew`, `gradlew.bat`, `gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar` and `gradle-wrapper.properties`. **Commit `gradle-wrapper.jar`** — the `.gitignore` below ignores `*.jar`, so add it with `git add -f gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar` (the current repo is missing this file; see Part C).

